+ *   2: every top-screen draw task (prio 0x65-0xE4) on in-between frames
+ *   3: every bottom-screen draw task (prio 0xE5-0x160) on in-between frames
+ *   4: left-eye 3D passes (prio 0x6B-0x77: models, HDR, afterimage, effects, filter) on in-between frames
